+/// Every ammunition type's `ammo_effects`: what its rounds do.
+///
+/// Reference: `islot_ammo::deserialize` (`src/item_factory.cpp:2990`), which reads the item's `"effects"` member into `itype::ammo_effects` with an
+/// `auto_flags_reader` — so the container is **cleared when stated** and the `extend`/`delete` operators apply like any other container member.
