+/// Every skill's own attack-time line: `--dump-skills`.
+///
+/// Reference: `struct time_info_t` (`src/skill.h:23-30`) - `min_time`, `base_time` and `time_reduction_per_level` - which `time_to_attack` (`ranged.cpp:2299-2308`) reads through the gun's
+/// own skill. The defaults in the struct (50, 220, 25) are **not** what the data usually says, so a port that assumed them would make every shot four times as slow.
+void dump_skills( const std::string &path )
+{
